  "prefLabel": "Per 102.89 Standard work period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.89 “Standard work period” means the weekly time period completed by a full-time employee who works from Monday through Friday.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.56); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.58); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.64); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.79), eff 12-1-25",
